---
// HowItWorks.astro
---
<section id="how-it-works" class="section bg-secondary">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</span>
      <h2>Up and running in three steps</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="steps-flow reveal-stagger">
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="step-number">01</div>
        <h3>Connect Your APIs</h3>
        <p>Point Pulse at your endpoints. Add a URL, set check frequency, done. No SDK, no code changes, no agents to install.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="connector desktop-only"></div>

      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="step-number">02</div>
        <h3>We Monitor 24/7</h3>
        <p>Pulse checks your endpoints from multiple regions every 30 seconds. We track response time, status codes, SSL, and content.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="connector desktop-only"></div>

      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="step-number">03</div>
        <h3>Get Alerted Instantly</h3>
        <p>When something breaks, your team knows within seconds. Alerts route to the right people with full context — not just a status code.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bg-secondary {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary);
  }
  .section {
    padding: 96px 0;
  }
  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }
  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .steps-flow {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .step {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 300px;
  }
  .step-number {
    font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
    font-size: 3rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    opacity: 0.5;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .step h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .step p {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .connector {
    display: none;
  }
  
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .steps-flow {
      flex-direction: row;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .connector {
      display: block;
      flex-grow: 1;
      height: 1px;
      border-top: 2px dashed var(--color-border);
      margin-top: 48px;
      opacity: 0.5;
    }
  }
</style>
